# Package for the Workspace domain within DevFlow.
#
# A Workspace represents an operational department or division within an
# Organization (e.g., Engineering, Design, Product, HR).
#
# Each Workspace belongs to exactly one Organization (Many-to-One).
# Workspaces contain:
#   - id (UUID)
#   - name (String)
#   - organization (Organization)
#   - visibility (WorkspaceVisibility: PUBLIC, PRIVATE)
#   - description (String, optional)
#   - createdAt, updatedAt, version (standard audit/concurrency)
#
# Reference: docs/architecture/DOMAIN_MODEL.md §3.1
# Reference: docs/security/AUTHORIZATION_MODEL.md §4.1

